  "interpretation": [
    "Research enabled and restricted conditions have nearly equal mean final population; enabled is lower by about 0.91 percentage points of starting population.",
    "Research wins more individual seeds (11 of 20) but has greater variance and several large losses, so technology is context-dependent under the current policy and world distribution.",
    "The enabled policy has a lower mean return and slightly more shortage. Research costs are not consistently recovered within 256 turns.",
    "The two runs completing all four technologies show a large positive descriptive mean, but two runs are far too few for a general claim.",
